["root", {"sectPr": {"pgSz": {"w": 892, "h": 1127}, "pgMar": {"top": 48, "bottom": 48, "left": 72, "right": 72, "header": 56.73, "footer": 66.13, "gutter": 0}}}, ["h1", {"uuid": "mv0m310pi1rkr2i9w4"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "第13章 被裁了怎么拿最多"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0tmibahkj697c7myv"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "本章讲被裁后怎么按法定标准把钱拿全：先判断该拿 N、N+1 还是 2N，签协议时把赔偿金额、支付时间和离职原因写清楚，再核对应结的年终奖、提成、未休年假和失业金。依据全国通用的《劳动合同法》《劳动争议调解仲裁法》等法律，涉及地方标准的会标注城市名。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m310qhcvk7bx05uf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h2", {"uuid": "mv0m310qu09e40uf6hs"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "极高性价比"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m310qhosszsmg8u4"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "1. 被约谈当天先不签字，把合同、工资流水、考勤和通知记录留存好"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m310qslge9fzxkp"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=中\n口径：收入 / 职业自由\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jo4ss40iqibdaz"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 被约谈当天先别表态，也别在现场签任何文件。真正决定赔偿多少的是工资基数、工作年限和解除性质，这三样都要靠合同、工资流水、考勤和书面通知来证明，先把材料存下来再谈条件。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jo4sevfoq9ewu7"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "0tvotzbgx5t", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4tkntw4ijqh5q"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "留最近 12 个月工资条或银行流水，用来算月平均工资基数"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "0tvotzbgx5t", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4tmnutps45dz"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "留劳动合同、社保缴费记录，用来算工作年限"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "0tvotzbgx5t", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4t70az587kgs6"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "录音只录自己参与的谈话，拍自己的合同、工资条不算获取商业秘密"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jo4tcojpb1d1s5t"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z0hllzo95i", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4tz32tzq8telj"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z0hllzo95i", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4tq13asl2e3ze"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2007）. 中华人民共和国劳动争议调解仲裁法. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/200712/t20071229_425587.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z0hllzo95i", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jo4uvfjgxho2qio"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "最高人民法院（2021）. 关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）. https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu-xiangqing-279771.html"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jo4umem48v7z6zh"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 留存证据只影响你能不能证明主张，不保证结果，金额还看解除性质和当地裁审口径；录音能否采信，取决于取得方式是否合法、内容是否完整。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m310rz9nnlrj4c9o"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m310rys2y6843lq"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "2. 签协议前先算清自己是 N、N+1 还是 2N，再对比公司给的数字"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m310rov59lwt4ty8"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jj9q2pacrrqf7lf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 公司说赔你 N+1，不一定就对。N 是经济补偿，N+1 是加一个月代通知金，2N 是违法解除赔偿金；先判断自己属于哪一档，再核对工资基数和工作年限。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jj9qzpe1vx2z5j"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tzxcpnxktc", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jj9rvaf6cyqxpm9"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "N 按工作每满一年一个月算，满 6 个月不满一年按一年，不满 6 个月算半个月"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tzxcpnxktc", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jj9r0xd77amrm7bl"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "基数是离职前 12 个月平均应发工资，含奖金、提成、补贴，按税前算"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tzxcpnxktc", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jj9rya1lvekn148"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "月工资超过当地上年度职工月平均工资 3 倍的，按 3 倍封顶，年限最多算 12 年"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jj9s7g8d184yoaa"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "3ad7254n789", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jj9sy49qn19k0go"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法（第 40、46、47、87 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "3ad7254n789", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jj9szuqccd3edkt"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（2008）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法实施条例. https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=284"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jj9tsvi8tskd8i"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 3 倍封顶按当地人社部门公布的上年度职工月平均工资算，各地数值不同；2008 年前工龄算法另有规定；年终奖是否计入 12 个月，各地口径不完全一致。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m310wu3xfju6b03"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m310wcr64kc3ouy6"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "3. 签协商解除协议前，把赔偿金额、支付时间、离职原因三项写清楚"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m310wjrlxza5qj7g"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入 / 职业自由\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jdm2vtpepxbc83"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话： 公司给的协议模板一般对自己有利，签字前至少改清三项：赔偿金额和支付时间、再无争议的范围、离职原因。调解或和解要写清金额和付款时间，放弃社保补缴、放弃工伤待遇这类条款不要签，离职原因写错还可能直接影响你领失业金。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jdm47e99m20m9ri"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6foo13eucpm", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm5mhhb3jb7kvj"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "写明补偿金额、支付日期、账户和逾期处理，不接受「另行协商」"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6foo13eucpm", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm5srzpmblcod"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "再无争议限定在「解除劳动关系相关事宜」，保留社保、公积金、工伤等法定权利"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6foo13eucpm", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm62yifcgt53ri"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "离职原因写「经用人单位提出、双方协商一致解除」，不要写个人原因"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "r1zdd5hnnsh", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1mynhgqiib5ercau"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "调解和解的写法：调解组织调解达成的协议要制作调解协议书，双方签名盖章、调解员签名并加盖调解组织印章后生效；仲裁庭裁决前应当先行调解，调解书经双方签收后与裁决书同等效力。写清金额、付款时间和方式、逾期怎么办，把「放弃其他请求」限定在本次明确列出的事项上；只写「一次性了结」不写金额、让你放弃社保补缴或工伤待遇、把违法辞退写成「自愿离职」的，都不要签。涉及工伤的，在没做工伤认定和劳动能力鉴定前签的私了协议，可能因重大误解或者显失公平被撤销。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jdm7uxmlmfn00vl"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ri98tq9xftj", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm70lndlqmzqn4q"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法（第 36 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ri98tq9xftj", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm8b8uca6pbv1e"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2010）. 中华人民共和国社会保险法（第 45 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201812/5d21f0f2b4d34a1ba8cf617fa0bdb76c.shtml"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ri98tq9xftj", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14jdm9l4id15qxnvj"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "最高人民法院（2021）. 关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）. https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu-xiangqing-279771.html"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tmpujw2fvs", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1myl5u8hre82pcxp"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "人力资源社会保障部、最高人民法院（2025）. 第四批劳动人事争议典型案例. 中华人民共和国最高人民法院. https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/462311.html"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14jdm9nxyqnd2aqjo"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议： 已签「再无争议」且金额明显偏低的，仍可主张撤销或差额，能否支持看差距和有无胁迫；社保、公积金补缴属行政征缴，不受该条款约束。调解书一旦签收即生效、不能反悔，签字前要算清自己能接受的最低下限；显失公平、重大误解可以请求撤销，但要打官司举证，成本不低。有的公司以调解为名拖延时间，谈判期间别把自己的仲裁时效放过期。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m310ypjdtj9gymq"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m310y4py7910sogt"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "4. 公司施压让你走时不要自己提离职，坚持正常出勤并留存书面异议"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m310zjlvwnoih6r8"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=中 精力=中\n口径：收入\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14j5385xhhhx0p0dm"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 遇到逼你走、调岗降薪、孤立冷处理，先别自己写离职申请。不主动提离职、不违纪、不旷工，主动权就在你手上；一旦写了个人原因离职，经济补偿通常就没了。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14j539y40pdkt1ck"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "h9mkb8b69tr", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14j539aff6h8t0xur"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "调岗降薪：书面表示不同意，继续按原岗位上班，降薪属未足额支付劳动报酬"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "h9mkb8b69tr", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14j539yc0vsifz28"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "被取消进场或考勤权限：拍照、截图，用邮件问原因，可能被认定为事实上解除"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "h9mkb8b69tr", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14j539xb1xyexhqqb"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "底线三条：不旷工、不违纪、不失联"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14j53a4kag6wqz6jf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "dtedd5gep4l", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14j53aoi70t1oiajj"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法（第 35、38、50 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "dtedd5gep4l", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14j53am4otyj7dpfm"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "劳动部（1994）. 工资支付暂行规定（第 9 条）. https://rsj.sh.gov.cn/trlzyhshbzbgz_17256/20200617/t0035_1388318.html"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14j53ashxz8vb58t"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 因公司违法被迫解除的，要先用书面形式通知公司并说明理由，再主张补偿；调岗是否成立看合理性，同城同级同薪多半认定合理，降薪、跨城、明显降级一般不被支持。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m3112q1fsuphfhln"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h2", {"uuid": "mv0m3112q8mgl0eb1no"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "高性价比"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m31131rn51g8bpra"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "5. 把年终奖、提成、未休年假折算和其他欠款一并写进结算清单"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m31134bbaraxp4h"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iyrmk58r76ds84b"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 被裁时只谈 N+1，容易漏掉年终奖、提成、未休年假和最后一个月工资，这些加起来可能顶几个月工资，谈之前先列一张结算清单。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iyrmb261tm9g9v"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6wpnly3uqze", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrnn7vkwk2t2ld"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "年终奖：合同或制度写明算法、你又完成考核周期的，按约发；年中被裁通常按在职时间折算"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6wpnly3uqze", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrn88te10o3yv5"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "提成：已完成业绩对应的提成离职时应结清，保留制度、业绩确认单、回款记录"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "6wpnly3uqze", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrni21jt7fmy3m"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "未休年假：工龄满 1 年 5 天、满 10 年 10 天、满 20 年 15 天，未休按日工资 300% 折算"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iyrn0s1xk0ypnfzq"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "sg9sqzf78xg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrnsgudaziyizp"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（2007）. 职工带薪年休假条例. http://www.gov.cn/flfg/2007-12/16/content_835527.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "sg9sqzf78xg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrodavdozcm23e"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "人力资源和社会保障部（2008）. 企业职工带薪年休假实施办法. http://www.mohrss.gov.cn/xxgk2020/fdzdgknr/zcfg/gfxwj/200809/t20080928_107268.html"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "sg9sqzf78xg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iyrot4ym62jbwa"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "劳动部（1994）. 工资支付暂行规定（第 9 条）. https://rsj.sh.gov.cn/trlzyhshbzbgz_17256/20200617/t0035_1388318.html"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iyro0xieavmi9wy"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 年终奖争议大，制度写明发放时不在册不发并经民主程序的，部分地区支持公司；未休年假工资时效各地不同，有的 1 年有的 2 年，建议尽快主张。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m311aexww1u0neyk"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m311aebxy4x5fi8o"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "6. 在协议里写明社保公积金缴到哪个月，并确认自己符合领失业金的条件"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m311azt0a61hi4yi"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入 / 职业寿命\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iub4meuad1xikls"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 被裁当月的社保、公积金由谁缴，各地规则不一样，口头说法不算数，写进协议最稳；同时确认自己是否符合领失业金的条件。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iub512tbmge3wnwc"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "k0ka1c0iil", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iub5guc93aszrim"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "协议写明「缴纳社保和公积金至某年某月」，离职后及时转移或按灵活就业续保"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "k0ka1c0iil", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iub5hgul7tdnjy"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "领失业金要「非因本人意愿中断就业」且缴费满 1 年，期限按缴费满 1 年、满 5 年、满 10 年分别最长 12、18、24 个月"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "k0ka1c0iil", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iub62600thuxbqy"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "领失业金期间，基本医疗保险费由失业保险基金代缴"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iub6twj5q8o7vno"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "yrp45c3mvv", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iub6s53k8i8ywm"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2010）. 中华人民共和国社会保险法（第 45、47 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201812/5d21f0f2b4d34a1ba8cf617fa0bdb76c.shtml"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "yrp45c3mvv", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iub67c7h6r3lc6m"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（1999）. 失业保险条例（第 17 条）. https://www.mohrss.gov.cn/wap/zc/fgwj/202011/t20201103_394936.html"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iub6b3puma7a7fm"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 离职原因写个人原因通常领不到失业金，这也是协议要写清解除原因的原因；各地对当月社保缴费判定不同，以参保地社保部门答复为准。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m311g9mip29vxaqi"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m311haaftub9totn"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "7. 试用期被以不合格辞退时，先要求公司出示录用条件和考核证据"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m311ha5vg9ffk98"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iphrgwyws5ue7pf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 试用期不是想开就开。公司以「不符合录用条件」解除，要先出示入职时约定的录用条件和考核证据，拿不出来通常构成违法解除，要赔 2N。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iphsccxaozauevv"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "mawbohvezw", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iphwcjqglu4151"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "合法解除要同时满足：有书面录用条件并经你签字、有考核记录、理由写「不符合录用条件」且在试用期内提出"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "mawbohvezw", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iphx0s0m5u95whka"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "只说你不合适却拿不出标准、试用期满后才说不合格，多数站不住"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "mawbohvezw", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iphxc8nabcgj0r"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "违法解除赔 2N；合法的不符合录用条件解除不赔，但公司举证责任重"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iphy1f3ccpm6hsg"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ihvglcl6kle", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14iphy4pnwasi2ggu"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法（第 19、21、39、40、87 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14iphzl9erda4bkp9"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 试用期工资不得低于同岗位最低档或合同约定工资的 80%，也不得低于当地最低工资；试用期最长 6 个月，同一单位对同一人只能约定一次。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m311mcmmfgf1y3cf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m311mg3i7wgco90r"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "8. 处于孕期、医疗期或工伤停工留薪期被辞退，先判断要赔偿还是要求继续履行"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m311m7rqiirrnxyo"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入 / 职业自由\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14il8s0cs9kkpcngc8"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 在孕期、产期、哺乳期，或医疗期、工伤停工留薪期内，公司不能随意解除。被辞退时你可以选择要 2N 走人，也可以要求继续履行合同，选择权在你。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14il8t0xe3yal0k5o9"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "updmdk9vgz", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8tandv9mflbsw"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "三期不得因怀孕解除、降薪；医疗期按工作年限 3 到 24 个月，期内不得依第 40、41 条解除"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "updmdk9vgz", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8u6no4t5nlqwd"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "工伤停工留薪期内不得解除，原工资福利待遇不变"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "updmdk9vgz", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8uxd7o5knl"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "保护期还长、产假待遇价值高的，要求继续履行更划算；想尽快了结的要赔偿金走人"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14il8uayqbi2paath"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3pg9bgamch", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8vf0iifyd9u3b"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2012）. 中华人民共和国劳动合同法（第 42、48 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/201212/t20121228_1877413.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3pg9bgamch", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8vzimcrnkp46"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（2012）. 女职工劳动保护特别规定. https://www.mohrss.gov.cn/xxgk2020/fdzdgknr/zcfg/fg/202011/t20201103_394947.html"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3pg9bgamch", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14il8vofujqv2qpta"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（2010）. 工伤保险条例（第 33 条）. https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=610"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14il8w88xjin6uey5"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 有严重违纪、营私舞弊造成重大损失等第 39 条情形的，即使在三期或医疗期也可能被合法解除；产假天数由各地奖励假叠加，以所在省份规定为准。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m311rq143gi3j9k"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m311skmlalq9hvp"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "9. 协商不成就在离职一年内申请劳动仲裁，仲裁不收费"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m311stu7glk4qgi"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=中 精力=中\n口径：收入\n证据等级：A"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14ifmvmjg4aabffr"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话： 谈不拢就走仲裁。劳动仲裁不收费，进入法院阶段劳动争议每件只交 10 元诉讼费；仲裁时效 1 年，从知道或者应当知道权利被侵害之日起算，中途主张过权利或对方同意履行会中断、不可抗力等原因会中止，拖欠工资在劳动关系存续期间不受这一年限制。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14ifmvgshdgfvt29j"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z4494mcny4", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14ifmwb9qhs4i097o"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "收到申请 5 个工作日内决定是否受理，受理后一般 45 日内审结，复杂可延 15 日"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z4494mcny4", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14ifmw3y16gjpak8s"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "可主张补偿或赔偿金、欠薪提成、加班费、未休年假工资、未签合同二倍工资等"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "z4494mcny4", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14ifmxck210dlhe96"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "备好仲裁申请书、身份证复印件、公司工商登记信息、证据清单和证据"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "albhonrvi3k", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1myf4ud0k8mpy8z6i"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "时效怎么算：一年从知道或者应当知道权利被侵害之日起计算；因一方向对方主张权利、向有关部门请求权利救济，或者对方同意履行义务而中断，从中断时起重新计算；因不可抗力或者其他正当理由不能申请仲裁的，时效中止，原因消除之日起继续计算。用邮件、消息或 EMS 明确催告并留记录，就是在中断时效。劳动关系存续期间因拖欠劳动报酬发生争议不受一年限制，劳动关系终止的，自终止之日起一年内提出，加班费属于劳动报酬、适用这条特别时效。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14ifmxyf4qi1jr3r"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "i576j5gy7bk", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14ifmx5zum0q48r4m"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2007）. 中华人民共和国劳动争议调解仲裁法（第 27、53 条）. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c12435/200712/t20071229_425587.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "i576j5gy7bk", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14ifmyakd1pbbbef8"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国务院（2006）. 诉讼费用交纳办法（第 13 条）. https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_512694.htm"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "akl0lhka5g4", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1mybn9xkxuwad6rid"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "湖南省人力资源和社会保障厅（2023）. 小法说法⑧：加班费的仲裁时效如何认定？. 湖南省人力资源和社会保障厅. https://rst.hunan.gov.cn/rst/qta/202312/t20231201_32453976.html （需在浏览器打开）"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14ifmyjvcvn6agluo"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议： 社保、公积金补缴不属仲裁受理范围，要分别向社保、公积金部门反映；部分小额争议适用一裁终局，公司不能起诉、劳动者仍可起诉。时效届满不必然被驳回，对方不提时效抗辩的、仲裁庭一般不主动适用；中断、中止要有可核对的记录，口头主张难以证明，主张过权利最好留文字。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m31206blljroes1m"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h2", {"uuid": "mv0m3120o70she2z0x"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "一般性价比"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m31216nwmexods5"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "10. 金额不大、证据齐全的可以自己申请仲裁，复杂或高额案件再找劳动争议专业律师"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m31213ry1mvz0q7s"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：一般\n成本：钱=中 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：收入\n证据等级：B"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i9rsfds5ya0ok2a"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话： 只主张经济补偿或赔偿金、证据齐全的简单案子，自己申请仲裁就行；涉及股权激励、竞业限制、商业秘密或金额较大的，再找专业律师。仲裁不收费但律师费一般自己出，事实清楚、金额不大的打 12348 免费咨询就够，经济困难、符合条件的还可以申请免费法律援助。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i9rtlt1wtpif2n9"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3ebuyc6pg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i9rt0tnmc82qwql"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "自己办：诉求明确、证据齐全、金额不大、愿意花时间研究"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3ebuyc6pg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i9ruw2ehpvr24q"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "请律师：涉股权期权、竞业限制、商业秘密，或公司有法务团队、态度强硬"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "p3ebuyc6pg", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i9rusb19s8tghod"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "经济困难、符合条件的，可向当地法律援助机构申请免费援助"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "8xrdnk6xfve", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1my6g0cq9vw2fpf4o"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "法律援助怎么申请：请求确认劳动关系或者支付劳动报酬、因经济困难没有委托代理人的，可以向法律援助机构申请法律援助（法律援助法第三十一条第五项）；申请支付劳动报酬或者请求工伤事故人身损害赔偿的进城务工人员，免予核查经济困难状况（第四十二条第三项）；工会等群团组织也可以提供法律援助（第六十八条）。拨 12348 公共法律服务热线能享免费法律咨询，工会 12351 提供职工维权帮助，各级公共法律服务中心和 12348 网上平台也能提交咨询和援助申请。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i9ru2uclni43zcy"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ib3501g18s", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i9ruhj78rrfa0wc"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国家发展和改革委员会、司法部（2006）. 律师服务收费管理办法. https://zfxxgk.ndrc.gov.cn/web/iteminfo.jsp?id=1690"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "ib3501g18s", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i9rv4e8yt6te3u"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "全国人民代表大会常务委员会（2021）. 中华人民共和国法律援助法. http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202110/t20211011_313713.html"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "4l3m0xc0w5l", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv1my251t8p86rozxgo"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "中国法律服务网（12348）. https://www.12348.gov.cn/"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i9rvzu1k7rs3wsf"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议： 律师费分政府指导价和市场调节价，各省标准不同，全国无统一价目；请律师不改变举证责任，证据不足时作用有限。法律援助要经审查，有各省确定的经济困难标准，不是人人都符合；律师费一般由委托方自担，胜诉也不当然由公司承担。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m31i3v9t3f917tk"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "mv0m31i3a8ojn05qe2u"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "11. 被裁后先给自己几天缓冲，别在情绪里谈赔偿或做决定"]]], ["p", {"blockquote": true, "uuid": "mv0m31i4zxmvtqr5h0g"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "性价比：一般\n成本：钱=0 时间=中 精力=高\n口径：时间精力 / 职业寿命\n证据等级：B"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i5pqsmovr2v0ru"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "说人话："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 被裁时先自我怀疑是常见反应，裁撤多数来自业务收缩和预算调整，和你的能力不直接相关；情绪上来时容易签下不该签的协议，先给自己几天缓冲。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i5prbzpzoj3fwzi"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "为什么 / 怎么做："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tnazgn7iknf", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i5ps7zwj6024ko"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "先把赔偿和结算谈清楚，再考虑对外公开"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tnazgn7iknf", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i5psizas6k4y7t"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "规律作息和运动，避免长时间独处"]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "tnazgn7iknf", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i5ptv961kcfd8ag"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "持续低落超过一个月、睡眠饮食明显受影响时寻求心理咨询，全国统一心理援助热线 12356 免费"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i5ptv98lar6o8a"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "来源："]]], ["p", {"list": {"listId": "itn9ldhf61", "isOrdered": false, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "bullet", "text": "●", "align": "left"}}, "uuid": "mv14i5pu6c8gganm6j"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "国家卫生健康委（2024）. 关于应用 12356 全国统一心理援助热线电话号码的通知. https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202412/content_6994470.htm"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv14i5pv6412sjk7l8g"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"bold": true, "data-type": "leaf"}, "限制与争议："], ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, " 没有专门针对被裁人群心理阶段的官方调查数据，本条属经验归纳，个体差异大；出现严重抑郁或有自伤念头，应尽快就医。"]]], ["hr", {"uuid": "mv0m31ib5cpqrtibr7h"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, ""]]], ["h2", {"uuid": "mv0m31ibjgd37mlxwi"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "快速查表：你大概能拿多少钱"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "mv0m31ic9h3frxgutie"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "假设月平均应发工资 15000 元，工作 3 年 4 个月："]]], ["table", {"colsWidth": [33.3, 33.3, 33.400000000000006], "tblW": {"type": "pct"}, "styleId": "tableHeader", "tblLook": {"firstRow": 1, "lastRow": 0, "firstColumn": 0, "lastColumn": 0}, "uuid": "mv15e52nwrwu2a2ahw"}, ["tr", {"isTblHeader": true, "uuid": "mv15e52n9qnzi05fz6a"}, ["tc", {"rowSpan": 1, "colSpan": 1, "uuid": "mv15e52nz55ntqb17yn"}, ["p", {"uuid": "mv15e52n3iw6ebthjkd"}, 